# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — keep it that way.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Only ODDS_API_KEY is required. Without the exchange credentials the board
# still shows every price (Kalshi and Polymarket US market data are public and
# free); you just cannot place orders from the UI.

# ---- required: sportsbook odds -----------------------------------------
# https://the-odds-api.com — the only source that costs credits.
# The free tier is 500 credits/month; the continuous refresh in the UI assumes
# a paid plan. See "Continuous refresh" in the README before switching it on.
ODDS_API_KEY=

# ---- optional: Kalshi trading ------------------------------------------
# https://kalshi.com → Account → API keys. Downloading a key gives you a .pem;
# put it anywhere OUTSIDE this repo and point at it with an absolute path.
# Market data needs no credentials — these only enable order placement.
KALSHI_API_KEY_ID=
KALSHI_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=/absolute/path/to/kalshi-private-key.pem

# ---- optional: Polymarket US trading -----------------------------------
# https://polymarket.us/developer, after completing KYC in their iOS app.
# Ed25519 keys — no wallet private key and no .pem. This is polymarket.US,
# the CFTC-regulated venue; the offshore polymarket.com CLOB is a different
# system and is not usable from the US.
POLYMARKET_KEY_ID=
POLYMARKET_SECRET_KEY=
